      "comment": "E-10 is evaluated per node. The root has three `item` edges, all indexed. Within `item[0]`, `tag` occurs twice and the second (integer) is wrong: `$.item[0].tag[1]`. Within `item[1]`, `tag` occurs once, so it carries no index although its parent does: `$.item[1].tag`. Within `item[2]`, `tag` occurs twice and the first (integer) is wrong: `$.item[2].tag[0]`."
